      "trackName": "Block Burst - WatchGame",
      "description": "Block Burst - Watch Game is a fast and satisfying puzzle experience designed for watchOS.\n\nPlace block shapes on an 8x8 board, clear full rows and columns, and keep the board alive as long as possible.\nSimple controls, smooth gameplay, and high replay value.\n\nFeatures:\n\nClassic block puzzle mechanics\nSmooth drag-and-drop controls for watch screens\nScore and Best Score tracking\nSound on/off toggle\nOffline gameplay\nQuick sessions for daily play\nNo account required. No internet required.",
